Package: pcmt
Title: Permutation-Calibrated Conditional Independence Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ziang", "Niu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ziangniu@example.com")
Description: Permutation-calibrated variants of the generalised covariance measure
    (GCM), projected covariance measure (PCM), and weighted GCM (WGCM) tests for
    conditional independence. These tests achieve exact validity under a strong
    exchangeable null and asymptotic validity under the weaker conditional null,
    providing two-way robustness. Built on top of the 'comets' package regression
    infrastructure.
